# Introduction

This R markdown document contains the complete code for determining the drivers of variation of bulk RNA-sequencing files for BITHub. All metadata and expression files were pre-processed using the code in `Bulk-preprocess-data.Rmd`. Results for deconvolution analysis was perfromed in `Bulk-deconvolution.Rmd`.  

<!-- important metadata were retained in `03-bulk-preprocess-data.Rmd` and deconvolution analysis was performed in `04-bulk-deconvolution.Rmd`.  -->

In order to rerun the scripts - make sure to change the directories to the location of where the input files for preprocessing are stored. All directories are defined in each dataset section. 

All other files are stored within the data folder of this R workflow directory. 

